          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What is common to the lines in the pictures above? They do not seem likely to intersect each other. Such lines are called parallel lines."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.282,
            0.823,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Parallel lines",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are a pair of lines that lie on the same plane, and do not meet however far we extend them at both ends."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.344,
            0.723,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Name some parallel lines you can spot in your classroom."
